  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Mic Button on the Keyboard that when pressed automatically mutes you to others and then when you talk it uses Speech-To-Text (STT) to input the Keyboard.\n\nLet's be rid of the days with slow and lazy text due to our relentless pecking and embrace a new future where we can easily use the chatbox, reply to requests, make announcements, and so on.",
